            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "In 2021 West Virginia enacted the Save Women\u2019s Sports Act, which bars male students from playing on female teams."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "43a1a329994be812c65f8b6f6bfd8c78f746b893b1ae3357510c603d44842fca",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-43a1a329994b-0000-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 1,
              "start": 1
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The case was argued on January\u202f13,\u202f2026 and decided on June\u202f30,\u202f2026."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "B. P. J.",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "43a1a329994be812c65f8b6f6bfd8c78f746b893b1ae3357510c603d44842fca",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-43a1a329994b-0001-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 13,
              "start": 13
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to B. P. J., according to B. P. J., according to B.\u202fP.\u202fJ., the central question was whether Title\u202fIX requires schools to allow transgender girls, such as B.\u202fP.\u202fJ., to compete on girls\u2019 sports teams."
      }
    ],
    "heading": "Background & Question",
    "status": "complete",
    "summary": null,
