              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to B. P. J., according to B. P. J., according to B. P. J., b.\u202fP.\u202fJ. relies on the 1974 Javits Amendment, which directs the Department of Health, Education, and Welfare to adopt reasonable provisions for particular sports."
