            }
          ],
          "text": "According to B. P. J., according to B. P. J., according to B. P. J., b.\u202fP.\u202fJ. cites Title\u202fVII (Bostock) and argues that its reasoning should extend to Title\u202fIX, requiring inclusion of transgender students on girls\u2019 teams."
